<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pernas started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pernas started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Tuesday it had started coverage of Malaysian conglomerate Pernas International Holdings Bhd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Pernas is trading at a discount to its peers and Caspian's 12-month price target is 5.20 ringgit a share, representing a 68 percent upside over the current price, analysts Michael Greenall, Angie Ang, Alex Thompson and Giok Pin wrote in a December 5 report.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
</text>
